        "cooked": "<p>On a (slightly <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=12\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\"> ) more serious note, I just saw an announcement of a new Marvel character being introduced in <em>What If…? Dark: Moon Knight</em> <span class=\"hashtag\">#1</span> named … <strong>Luminary</strong>! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/astonished.png?v=12\" title=\":astonished:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":astonished:\"></p>",
